# Quorian Oneiromancer

## Lore

Quorian Oneiromancers, also known as Dream Shamans, are the spiritual, religious and psychic centers of Quorian society. Possessing strange powers of the mind and spirit, these mysterious individuals often lead Quorian villages and wandercamps - groups of nomadic hunters and warriors - and use magic, psychic powers and the interpretation of dreams to see the future.

The Quorians are a superstitious people who take precognitive dream-visions very seriously, and most have only two or three in their lives. An Oneiromancer''s Chant of Dreaming brings such a vision on demand, which is why Oneiromancers are revered above the race''s shamans and Psi-Mystics as interpreters of dreams and diviners of the future - though their readings are not always correct, and sometimes serve the tribe more than the truth.

## GM Notes

In game terms the Oneiromancer is the Mystic with a different set of starting powers and the Chant of Dreaming. The Mystic''s sensing of supernatural evil, its trance and its P.P.E. are unchanged.
